Especially when you look at just the S&amp;P 500, when you look at things like the Russell 2000,

01:31:58.420 --> 01:32:00.900
it becomes even more impractical.

01:32:00.900 --> 01:32:05.900
For us, there are two options, index mutual funds and index ETFs, which are similar to

